     [38;5;246mSettings module maps hostname -> endpoint and resolves at load time, with a ?env= override for local testing [39m
     [38;5;246magainst staging. No build step needed.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Single edited value
     [38;5;246mSettings module exports one config object; changing environments means editing that one value before deploy. [39m
     [38;5;246mSimplest, but manual.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Build-time injection
     [38;5;246mEndpoint stamped in by a bundler or substitution script per environment. Most robust, but adds tooling this repo [39m
